---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /lineups/
title: "Lineups de CS2 - Smokes, Flashes e Molotovs por mapa | CSTatics Brasil"
description: "Biblioteca de lineups de Counter-Strike 2 em português: smokes, flashes, molotovs e HE para Mirage, Inferno, Dust2, Nuke, Ancient e Anubis. Aprenda as jogadas certas."
---

<section class="lineups-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Biblioteca de utilitária</span>
        <h1 class="section-head__title">Lineups</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="section-head__rule"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lineups-hero__subtitle">
      Smokes, flashes, molotovs e HE com posição de arremesso, tipo de lançamento e
      passo a passo. Filtre por mapa, lado, bombsite e dificuldade.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lineups-section">
  <div class="container">
    <input type="search" id="lineupsSearch" class="search-input" placeholder="Buscar lineup por nome, posição ou tag (ex: smoke CT, banana...)" aria-label="Buscar lineups">

    <div class="filter-bar">
      <div class="filter-row">
        <span class="filter-row__label">Mapa</span>
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="map:all">Todos</button>
        {% for map in maps.maps %}
          {% if map.active %}
            <button class="chip" data-filter="map:{{ map.slug }}">{{ map.name }}</button>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="filter-row">
        <span class="filter-row__label">Utilitária</span>
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="utility:all">Todas</button>
        {% for u in navigation.utilities %}
          <button class="chip" data-filter="utility:{{ u.slug }}">{{ u.name }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="filter-row">
        <span class="filter-row__label">Lado</span>
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="side:all">Ambos</button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="side:t">T</button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="side:ct">CT</button>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-row">
        <span class="filter-row__label">Dificuldade</span>
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="difficulty:all">Todas</button>
        {% for d in navigation.difficulties %}
          <button class="chip" data-filter="difficulty:{{ d.slug }}">{{ d.name }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="results-count"><span id="resultsCount">{{ lineups.lineups | length }}</span> lineups encontrados</p>

    <div class="lineups-grid" id="lineupsGrid">
      {% for lineup in lineups.lineups %}
        {% include "components/lineup-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="empty-state hidden" id="emptyState">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass empty-state__icon"></i>
      <h2 class="empty-state__title">Nenhum lineup encontrado</h2>
      <p class="empty-state__description">Tente ajustar os filtros ou o termo de busca.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/lineups.js" defer></script>

<style>
  .lineups-hero {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0 var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .lineups-hero .section-head { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg); }

  .lineups-hero .section-head__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
  }

  .lineups-hero__subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    max-width: 62ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .lineups-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) 0 var(--spacing-4xl);
  }

  .lineups-section .search-input {
    max-width: 100%;
  }
</style>
